(API Coverage Matrix) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Capability | API/Primitive | Coverage Status | Notes |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| Bulk upsert | salesforce_upsert | Covered | Supports external_id_field, optional wait |) Tj
T*
(| Bulk insert | salesforce_insert | Covered | Batch insert through Bulk API 2.0 |) Tj
T*
(| Bulk update | salesforce_update | Covered | Expects Salesforce Id in records |) Tj
T*
(| Bulk delete | salesforce_delete | Covered | Expects Salesforce Id in records |) Tj
T*
(| Generic bulk orchestration | SalesforceBulkWriteOperator | Covered |) Tj
T*
(insert/update/upsert/delete/hardDelete |) Tj
T*
(| Upsert operator wrapper | SalesforceUpsertOperator | Covered | Convenience wrapper over) Tj
T*
(generic operator |) Tj
T*
(| UC connection auth via proxy | internal request path | Covered | Uses conn_id + UC proxy |) Tj
T*
(| Connection base-path fallback | internal request path | Covered | Retries alternate path style) Tj
T*
(on 404 |) Tj
T*
(| CSV LF line-ending compliance | internal serialization | Covered | Uses LF for Salesforce) Tj
T*
(ingest compatibility |) Tj
T*
(| Task value propagation | functions/operators | Covered | Writes metadata best-effort to task) Tj
T*
(values |) Tj
T*
(| Deferrable sensor for Salesforce | N/A in this repo | Not in scope | Intentionally removed for) Tj
T*
(this implementation |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
