BT
/F1 10 Tf
14 TL
50 742 Td
(Function Runtime Behavior) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Common internal flow for all write functions:) Tj
T*
(1. Coerce and validate records payload) Tj
T*
(2. Convert records to CSV with Salesforce-compatible LF line endings) Tj
T*
(3. Create Bulk API ingest job) Tj
T*
(4. Upload batch CSV) Tj
T*
(5. Set job state to UploadComplete) Tj
T*
(6. Optionally poll to terminal state when wait_for_completion=True) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Robustness features:) Tj
T*
(- UC proxy path fallback for host-only vs base_path-style connections) Tj
T*
(- best-effort task value writes \(salesforce_job_id, salesforce_object, salesforce_operation\)) Tj
T*
(- explicit error raising on create/upload/close failures) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Operators API) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SalesforceBulkWriteOperator) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Full lifecycle operator for external orchestration:) Tj
T*
(- open\(\) -> creates and submits Salesforce Bulk job) Tj
T*
(- poll\(\) -> checks job state and defers between checks) Tj
T*
(- close\(\) -> attempts cleanup/abort for non-terminal jobs) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Supported operations:) Tj
T*
(- insert) Tj
T*
(- update) Tj
T*
(- upsert) Tj
T*
(- delete) Tj
T*
(- hardDelete) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Constructor parameters:) Tj
T*
(- object_name: str) Tj
T*
(- operation: str) Tj
T*
(- records: str) Tj
T*
(- conn_id: str) Tj
T*
(- task_key: str) Tj
T*
(- external_id_field: str = "") Tj
T*
(- api_version: str = "v60.0") Tj
T*
(- poll_interval_minutes: int = 1) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Poll outcomes:) Tj
T*
(- JobComplete -> SensorResult.completed\(\)) Tj
T*
(- Failed / Aborted -> raises exception) Tj
T*
(- transient states -> SensorResult.deferred\(...\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
