(Error Model) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Failures surface as Python exceptions with contextual messages, including:) Tj
T*
(- UC proxy request failures \(status + response text\)) Tj
T*
(- validation failures for payload/schema) Tj
T*
(- terminal Salesforce job failures \(Failed, Aborted\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Deployment and Invocation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    python3 setup.py bdist_wheel) Tj
T*
(    databricks bundle validate --profile dogfood) Tj
T*
(    databricks bundle deploy --profile dogfood) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    # Function workflow) Tj
T*
(    databricks bundle run salesforce_full_workflow --profile dogfood) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    # Operator workflow) Tj
T*
(    databricks bundle run salesforce_upsert_operator --profile dogfood) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Notes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
